# What NOT to upload to Homey / the App Store. The Homey CLI reads only this file plus its
# defaults (dotfiles, .homeybuild, tsconfig.json, env.json, *.compose.json, node_modules) —
# it does NOT read .gitignore, so anything secret must be listed here explicitly.

# Secrets and local sessions (also dotfiles, but never rely on that)
.verisure-session.json
.upstream-cookie
*.env

# Development only
/reference/
/test/
/scripts/
/lib/pair/
AGENTS.md
README.md
*.log
.DS_Store
CONTRIBUTING.md
/docs/
